 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "h",
   "es": "1 · En la tienda del barrio",
   "en": ""
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Buenas tardes, Marina. ¿[[c1_que_necesitas|Qué necesitas]] hoy?",
   "en": "Good afternoon, Marina. What do you need today?",
   "who": "Tendero",
   "audio": "audio/c1_01_Tendero.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Hola. Una [[c1_docena_de_huevos|docena de huevos]], por favor.",
   "en": "Hi. A dozen eggs, please.",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c1_02_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Aquí tienes. ¿[[c1_algo_mas|Algo más]]?",
   "en": "Here you are. Anything else?",
   "who": "Tendero",
   "audio": "audio/c1_03_Tendero.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí, un kilo de patatas y una cebolla.",
   "en": "Yes, a kilo of potatoes and an onion.",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c1_04_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿Vas a hacer una tortilla?",
   "en": "Are you going to make an omelette?",
   "who": "Tendero",
   "audio": "audio/c1_05_Tendero.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Sí! Esta noche viene una amiga a cenar.",
   "en": "Yes! A friend is coming for dinner tonight.",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c1_06_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Qué bien! ¿Con cebolla o sin cebolla?",
   "en": "How nice! With onion or without?",
   "who": "Tendero",
   "audio": "audio/c1_07_Tendero.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Con cebolla, claro.",
   "en": "With onion, of course.",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c1_08_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Un consejo: dale la vuelta con un plato grande.",
   "en": "A tip: flip it with a big plate.",
   "who": "Tendero",
   "audio": "audio/c1_09_Tendero.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Gracias. Estoy un poco nerviosa.",
   "en": "Thanks. I'm a bit nervous.",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c1_10_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "[[c1_no_te_preocupes|No te preocupes]]. ¡Te va a salir muy bien!",
   "en": "Don't worry. It's going to turn out great!",
   "who": "Tendero",
   "audio": "audio/c1_11_Tendero.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿Cuánto es?",
   "en": "How much is it?",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c1_12_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Cuatro euros con veinte. ¡Que aproveche!",
   "en": "Four euros twenty. Enjoy your meal!",
   "who": "Tendero",
   "audio": "audio/c1_13_Tendero.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "h",
   "es": "2 · En la puerta",
   "en": ""
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Hola, Marina! ¿[[c2_llego_pronto|Llego pronto]]?",
   "en": "Hi, Marina! Am I early?",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c2_01_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡No, llegas perfecta! [[c2_pasa_pasa|Pasa, pasa]].",
   "en": "No, you're right on time! Come in, come in.",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c2_02_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Mira, he traído una tarta de queso para el postre.",
   "en": "Look, I've brought a cheesecake for dessert.",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c2_03_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Qué bonita! ¿La has hecho tú?",
   "en": "How lovely! Did you make it?",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c2_04_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí, es la receta de mi abuela.",
   "en": "Yes, it's my grandmother's recipe.",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c2_05_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Gracias! Pero tengo que decirte algo…",
   "en": "Thanks! But I have to tell you something…",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c2_06_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿[[c2_que_pasa|Qué pasa]]?",
   "en": "What's wrong?",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c2_07_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "La tortilla se ha roto. ¡[[c2_que_apuro|Qué apuro]]!",
   "en": "The omelette has broken. How embarrassing!",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c2_08_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Ja, ja! No te preocupes.",
   "en": "Ha ha! Don't worry.",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c2_09_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Pero quería una cena perfecta…",
   "en": "But I wanted a perfect dinner…",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c2_10_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Una tortilla rota también está rica.",
   "en": "A broken omelette is tasty too.",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c2_11_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "[[c2_tienes_razon|Tienes razón]]. ¿Me ayudas con la ensalada?",
   "en": "You're right. Will you help me with the salad?",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c2_12_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Claro! ¿Dónde está el delantal?",
   "en": "Of course! Where's the apron?",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c2_13_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "h",
   "es": "3 · En la mesa",
   "en": ""
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Bueno, la cena está lista. ¡Siéntate!",
   "en": "Well, dinner is ready. Sit down!",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c3_01_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡[[c3_que_buena_pinta|Qué buena pinta]] tiene todo!",
   "en": "Everything looks so good!",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c3_02_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Hay gazpacho, tortilla y ensalada.",
   "en": "There's gazpacho, omelette and salad.",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c3_03_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Entonces… ¡brindamos!",
   "en": "Then… let's make a toast!",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c3_04_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Por nuestra clase de cocina!",
   "en": "To our cooking class!",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c3_05_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡[[c3_salud|Salud]]! Y… ¡buen provecho!",
   "en": "Cheers! And… enjoy your meal!",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c3_06_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡[[c3_igualmente|Igualmente]]!",
   "en": "You too!",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c3_07_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Mmm, la tortilla está buenísima.",
   "en": "Mmm, the omelette is delicious.",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c3_08_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿De verdad? ¿No está muy seca?",
   "en": "Really? Isn't it too dry?",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c3_09_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "No, está perfecta. ¿Me pasas el pan?",
   "en": "No, it's perfect. Can you pass me the bread?",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c3_10_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Toma. ¿Quieres más gazpacho?",
   "en": "Here. Do you want more gazpacho?",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c3_11_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí, un poco más, por favor.",
   "en": "Yes, a bit more, please.",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c3_12_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡[[c3_me_alegro|Me alegro]] mucho de que te guste!",
   "en": "I'm so glad you like it!",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c3_13_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "h",
   "es": "4 · Con la vecina en la escalera",
   "en": ""
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Buenos días, Marina. ¡Anoche había mucha alegría en tu casa!",
   "en": "Good morning, Marina. There was a lot of fun at your place last night!",
   "who": "Vecina",
   "audio": "audio/c4_01_Vecina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡[[c4_ay_perdon|Ay, perdón]]! ¿Hicimos mucho ruido?",
   "en": "Oh, sorry! Did we make a lot of noise?",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c4_02_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "No, [[c4_no_te_preocupes|no te preocupes]]. Solo risas.",
   "en": "No, don't worry. Just laughter.",
   "who": "Vecina",
   "audio": "audio/c4_03_Vecina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Es que vino mi amiga Laura a cenar.",
   "en": "It's just that my friend Laura came for dinner.",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c4_04_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Qué bien! ¿Y qué cocinaste?",
   "en": "How nice! And what did you cook?",
   "who": "Vecina",
   "audio": "audio/c4_05_Vecina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Gazpacho y tortilla… pero la tortilla se rompió.",
   "en": "Gazpacho and omelette… but the omelette broke.",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c4_06_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Ja, ja! [[c4_a_mi_me_pasa_siempre|A mí me pasa siempre]].",
   "en": "Ha ha! It always happens to me.",
   "who": "Vecina",
   "audio": "audio/c4_07_Vecina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿De verdad? ¿Y qué hace usted?",
   "en": "Really? And what do you do?",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c4_08_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Uso una sartén pequeña y mucho aceite.",
   "en": "I use a small frying pan and lots of oil.",
   "who": "Vecina",
   "audio": "audio/c4_09_Vecina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡[[c4_gracias_por_el_consejo|Gracias por el consejo]]!",
   "en": "Thanks for the tip!",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c4_10_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "De nada. ¿Me guardas un poco la próxima vez?",
   "en": "You're welcome. Will you save me some next time?",
   "who": "Vecina",
   "audio": "audio/c4_11_Vecina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Claro! Ahora tengo un poco en la nevera.",
   "en": "Of course! I have a little in the fridge right now.",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c4_12_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡[[c4_que_amable|Qué amable]] eres! ¡Buen provecho para mí, entonces!",
   "en": "How kind you are! Enjoy my meal, then! (joke)",
   "who": "Vecina",
   "audio": "audio/c4_13_Vecina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "v",
   "es": "Frases clave de la semana"
  }
